=========
Changelog
=========

Dates follow main/* release tags where available; other legacy dates are retained.
References identify source commits; development entries do not announce a tagged release.

Version 1.6.0 (development) [2026-11-04]
****************************************

- APP: Add point interpolation and time-series averaging (9828719).
- APP: Add JSON-driven Flask dashboard, calendar, section maps, deterministic/ensemble hydrographs and setup (working tree).
- WORKFLOW: Integrate RainFARM ensembles, pickle/NetCDF/Zarr ancillary storage and native NetCDF output (b947ffe, 3c22162).
- PACKAGE: Refactor datasets, processes and decorators; fix time parsing and missing RFarm slopes (4c8620d..3c22162).
- DOCUMENTATION: Publish docs edition 0.1.0, Sphinx CI, local images and README links (4b0580b, b947ffe, 8eaae8c).

Version 1.2.4 [2026-08-27]
**************************

- APP: Add watershed delineation from section coordinates (d3f850f).
- WORKFLOW: Improve evapotranspiration merging over a reference domain (3fab4e4).
- PACKAGE: Correct missing-data handling in the HMC evapotranspiration merger (08a08da, 37c46de).

Version 1.2.3 [2026-08-21]
**************************

- APP: Add geographic domain-mask management (198a322).
- WORKFLOW: Add evapotranspiration map merging over a reference domain (4c890df).
- PACKAGE: Include HMC simulated/observed NetCDF time-series fixes (79bd9a4, e7720e2, 6f2c986).

Version 1.2.2 [2026-08-18]
**************************

- APP: Update observed-point conversion and HMC simulated/observed NetCDF time-series applications (566ff6e).
- WORKFLOW: Fix generation of simulation and observation time-series results (29785ef).

Version 1.2.1 [2026-08-12]
**************************

- APP: Update applications generating time series from observed-point files (dff80ae).
- ENVIRONMENT: Update the corresponding Docker application configuration (dff80ae).

Version 1.2.0 [2026-08-06]
**************************

- APP: Add observed/simulated hydrograph analysis and discharge-comparison tools (eb4faf3, eddc5af).
- WORKFLOW: Add soil-moisture tile merging and evapotranspiration processing (70c1f23, 403898e).
- PACKAGE: Improve time selection, mandatory-file checks and IFS rainfall conversion (31a4b81, 9010b81, dc48622).
- ENVIRONMENT: Update converter, runner and analyzer containers (26c0a93, 9683dff).

Version 1.1.0 [2026-01-16]
**************************

- APP: Introduce the Continuum web dashboard and HMC/S3M workflow updates (8f8a268, 63db3e3, 233c4ba).
- WORKFLOW: Refactor workflows around configuration, logging, time and grid/time-series orchestrators (2d7f2eb).
- PACKAGE: Add model execution metadata and fix sequential-stream logging deadlocks (04e2f1a, 19a46f0).
- PACKAGE: Add time-series dataset handlers and default to stream logging (5af2d35, 8823b2b).

Version 1.0.4 [2025-11-21]
**************************

- WORKFLOW: Extend process, time and workflow management; improve model-version selection.
- PACKAGE: Introduce argument, configuration and logging managers.
- ENVIRONMENT: Update the Conda installer.

Version 1.0.3 [2025-11-16]
**************************

- APP: Extend HMC converter, merger and runner applications to additional datasets.
- WORKFLOW: Improve time management, logging and application execution.

Version 1.0.2 [2025-07-16]
**************************

- APP: Add HMC converter, merger and model-runner applications.

Version 1.0.1 [2025-03-15]
**************************

- APP: Add S3M converter, merger and model-runner applications.

Version 1.0.0 [2025-01-24]
**************************

- PACKAGE: Establish the beta package layout, base classes and initial code refactoring (c19fbf8).
- ENVIRONMENT: Introduce environment management.

